# Security Rules

- Never expose API keys or credentials in code or repository commits.
- Use `.env.example` for secret templates; load values via `src/config.py`.
- Enforce strict parameter validation on amounts (`0 < amount <= authorized_amount`).
- Treat AI agents as untrusted callers.
- Preserve immutable audit logging for all transactions and reconciliation checks.
